<title>NEW ZEALAND: Otter posts 1st half loss of NZ$1.97 mln.</title>
<headline>Otter posts 1st half loss of NZ$1.97 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				1.97 vs 1.29 profit</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 4.2 vs 2.9 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover			     33.28 vs 10.28</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 3.38 vs 2.59</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.01 vs 0.87</p>
<p>    Abnormals			     4.38 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    46.8 vs 39.4</p>
<p>Note - Otter Gold Mines Ltd is a gold mining company. Otter said it had received a New Zealand High Court judgement payment of NZ$4.141 million from a legal action against Poseidon Gold Ltd Group companies (Posgold) which was brought into account as revenue at June 30, 1996. However, Posgold successfully appealed</p>
</text>
